WEBVTT

00:00:51.918 --> 00:00:55.252
Arusu was placed on a ship to
the Human Realm by Sheila...

00:00:55.355 --> 00:00:58.689
...and she meets a pirate witch
who attacks them on the way.

00:00:59.192 --> 00:01:03.527
Then she finds out about the
destruction of the Magical Realm.

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:06.992
The pirate's name is Lennon.

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:09.835
Who could this pirate be?

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:14.698
Arusu tries to go back to
Witch Heaven with Lennon, but...

00:01:15.108 --> 00:01:18.567
...their ship suddenly exploded.

00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:50.134
Tweeny Witches

00:02:54.674 --> 00:02:59.271
Traitor Among the Witches

00:03:01.247 --> 00:03:06.515
We don't have much time.
There's only one way for us to survive.

00:03:06.786 --> 00:03:10.120
A new realm will be created
by the power of dark magic.

00:03:10.657 --> 00:03:14.093
Hurry up and get the fairies
and the True Book of Spells!

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:17.230
Go! My elite warriors!

00:03:18.331 --> 00:03:20.527
We must protect our future!

00:03:21.601 --> 00:03:23.501
By the way, Grande...

00:03:23.903 --> 00:03:27.396
...what about the witch who is
capable of using dark magic?

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:30.541
We practically have her
in our possession.

00:03:38.351 --> 00:03:39.546
You're not eating?

00:03:41.221 --> 00:03:42.416
You can eat.

00:03:43.523 --> 00:03:45.116
| enjoyed the meal.

00:03:48.428 --> 00:03:49.862
Where's Arusu?

00:03:51.297 --> 00:03:53.288
Sheila, you didn't...

00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:54.264
She's...

00:03:54.567 --> 00:03:56.399
Arusu isn't here anymore.

00:03:56.502 --> 00:03:57.298
Why?

00:03:57.704 --> 00:04:00.196
She found out that she could go home.

00:04:02.041 --> 00:04:02.837
Why?

00:04:03.042 --> 00:04:06.068
Arusu said we're going to
protect magic together!

00:04:06.312 --> 00:04:08.804
We even formed a Magical Girl Squad!

00:04:08.948 --> 00:04:11.315
And you seemed excited
yesterday, Sheila...

00:04:12.885 --> 00:04:16.844
You put Arusu on the ship
when she was asleep?

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:17.684
Yeah.

00:04:18.391 --> 00:04:21.019
That's just wrong!
To deceive her like that?

00:04:21.861 --> 00:04:24.455
Tell me! Why did you do such a thing?

00:04:24.564 --> 00:04:27.932
Why did you decide to do
such a thing on your own?

00:04:29.469 --> 00:04:30.595
Shut up!

00:04:37.443 --> 00:04:40.310
We can't just stay here
and do nothing, right?

00:04:41.781 --> 00:04:45.615
Whether she's around or not,
we still have things to do.

00:04:55.895 --> 00:04:56.538
Let's go!

00:04:56.562 --> 00:04:57.120
Let's go!
What?

00:05:01.434 --> 00:05:02.026
You!

00:05:02.402 --> 00:05:03.130
Get her!

00:05:06.873 --> 00:05:08.432
Sheila! Watch out!

00:05:13.846 --> 00:05:14.779
Disappear!

00:05:19.252 --> 00:05:20.276
Retreat!

00:05:24.691 --> 00:05:27.160
Was that really necessary?

00:05:29.295 --> 00:05:31.423
Take this and
go to the holding facility.

00:05:31.531 --> 00:05:32.157
What?

00:05:32.265 --> 00:05:33.755
| have some work left to do.

00:05:33.866 --> 00:05:36.164
Wait! Why the holding facility?

00:05:36.269 --> 00:05:39.000
To have the Curse of Eternal Youth
removed from us.

00:05:39.105 --> 00:05:41.870
We agreed with Arusu
to protect magic, but...

00:05:41.974 --> 00:05:43.652
...to keep the fairies roaming free...

00:05:43.676 --> 00:05:45.906
...to keep the fairies roaming free...
You just do what you're told!

00:05:49.649 --> 00:05:51.913
| feel the same way you do...

00:06:06.332 --> 00:06:08.460
| really don't want to do this.

00:06:10.303 --> 00:06:12.670
"That's right.
That's what I'm telling you."

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:17.799
"But don't let the others know
that I contacted you."

00:06:18.745 --> 00:06:20.509
