what they might do to us?"

00:06:28.855 --> 00:06:31.517
"Well, I'm looking
forward to receiving this."

00:06:31.891 --> 00:06:34.087
"A king-sized Mont Blanc cake."

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:35.721
This one's not it.

00:06:37.397 --> 00:06:39.832
| can't believe I'm spying on friends.

00:06:40.767 --> 00:06:41.632
No!

00:06:42.368 --> 00:06:45.394
Even if that's the grand master's wish,
I don't want to...

00:06:45.505 --> 00:06:49.635
...find a witch who uses dark magic
and teams up with warlocks.

00:06:50.543 --> 00:06:51.237
But...

00:06:52.779 --> 00:06:55.749
