00:06:56.149 --> 00:06:58.550
If I find this witch
who uses dark magic...

00:06:58.651 --> 00:07:02.986
...then I want you to remove it.
The Curse of Eternal Youth that is.

00:07:03.089 --> 00:07:05.956
Even if it's just for Eva,
I want you to remove it.

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:10.395
But I have to do it.

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:12.830
