00:07:13.633 --> 00:07:14.930
You can do it...

00:07:15.067 --> 00:07:17.559
As long as you don't lose
the ray of hope...

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:20.298
Who's there? Who was that?

00:07:21.207 --> 00:07:23.699
Because this realm is...

00:07:24.944 --> 00:07:28.141
We can't live in this realm anymore...

00:07:32.852 --> 00:07:35.583
