in the Human Realm.

00:08:39.952 --> 00:08:43.354
| see. So I'm just a nuisance.

00:08:43.456 --> 00:08:44.719
That's not it.

00:08:44.991 --> 00:08:46.015
Then why?

00:08:46.125 --> 00:08:48.059
Why do you say such a thing?

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:49.059
Why?

00:08:50.897 --> 00:08:52.541
It's going to be destroyed.

00:08:52.565 --> 00:08:53.123
It's going to be destroyed.
What?

00:08:53.866 --> 00:08:56.392
This realm will be gone.

00:08:57.136 --> 00:08:58.069
No way.

00:08:59.372 --> 00:09:00.931
