00:09:02.608 --> 00:09:04.201
It can't be true!

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:05.004
Eva!

00:09:09.315 --> 00:09:10.612
Presatio?

00:09:14.153 --> 00:09:17.555
When one of her followers went
to her room, she was already...

00:09:17.723 --> 00:09:19.851
It can't be. Yesterday, she was...

00:09:19.959 --> 00:09:20.755
Yesterday?

00:09:21.794 --> 00:09:24.263
Don't tell me it was the grand master.

00:09:25.031 --> 00:09:26.760
Then it's my fault?

00:09:27.133 --> 00:09:29.033
