00:09:30.236 --> 00:09:34.139
Sheila? Is there something wrong
with the grand master?

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:34.968
No.

00:09:35.875 --> 00:09:38.105
Anyway, now I understand perfectly.

00:09:38.210 --> 00:09:42.113
The grand master collapsed,
and now Presatio.

00:09:42.682 --> 00:09:45.583
These are foreshadows of destruction.

00:09:45.885 --> 00:09:47.410
Destruction...

00:09:48.588 --> 00:09:51.114
The power of magic is getting weaker.

00:09:51.223 --> 00:09:54.352
The magical light is about to die.

00:09:56.362 --> 00:09:59.229
Isn't there something you can do?

00:09:59.932 --> 00:10:01.991
You can't do anything about it?

00:10:03.836 --> 00:10:06.100
This destruction will come and...

00:10:06.205 --> 00:10:09.266
