Even you.

00:10:10.676 --> 00:10:13.737
Soon, everyone is going to
find out the truth.

00:10:14.347 --> 00:10:19.410
When that time comes, Credelle or
myself might not be around either.

00:10:21.454 --> 00:10:25.152
Sheila. That's when you have to
address the public.

00:10:25.257 --> 00:10:29.626
They'll be afraid. You must tell them to
keep their composure till the very end.

00:10:29.762 --> 00:10:32.959
