a witch till the very end.

00:10:33.532 --> 00:10:35.967
Since you found out about it
before other people...

00:10:36.068 --> 00:10:38.469
...you must do this
as your last mission.

00:10:39.205 --> 00:10:40.570
It can't be true!

00:10:43.909 --> 00:10:45.775
That's impossible.

00:10:46.245 --> 00:10:50.375
I'm not that great of a witch.
| can't provide people with hope...

00:10:51.484 --> 00:10:53.350
I'm not like Arusu...

00:10:56.555 --> 00:10:58.717
Wait a minute. She was...

00:11:00.626 --> 00:11:02.685
What Arusu was screaming...

00:11:02.895 --> 00:11:05.330
What she kept on screaming about...

00:11:05.731 --> 00:11:07.165
It was hope!

00:11:09.502 --> 00:11:12.472
| can't believe it took
this long to realize that...

00:11:32.658 --> 00:11:35.650
Tweeny Witches

00:11:40.199 --> 00:11:44.659
Light of Hope

00:11:50.543 --> 00:11:51.953
Why are you here?

00:11:51.977 --> 00:11:54.446
Why are you here?
Oh man. That was just too much.

00:11:54.547 --> 00:11:58.142
| was hungry, so I tried to fish, then
| fell into the Interdimensional Sea.

00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:00.981
You had a chance to go back
to the Human Realm.

00:12:02.154 --> 00:12:03.952
I know everything now.

00:12:04.857 --> 00:12:07.292
You're giving me a hard time, Sheila.

00:12:07.393 --> 00:12:10.954
You wanted to look cool by
doing everything on your own.

00:12:11.363 --> 00:12:13.525
| wasn't trying to...

00:12:14.633 --> 00:12:15.210
What's wrong?

00:12:15.234 --> 00:12:17.202
What's wrong?
There's nothing wrong with me.

00:12:22.475 --> 00:12:25.206
Hey! Are you okay?

00:12:28.280 --> 00:12:32.239
So you came here with this pirate
who attacked your boat?

00:12:32.685 --> 00:12:36.280
That's right.
But the pirate ship was capsized.

00:12:38.390 --> 00:12:41.416
The pirate's sick from living
on the Interdimensional Sea...

00:12:41.527 --> 00:12:43.052
...for a very long time.

00:12:43.162 --> 00:12:44.873
And might die if we don't do anything.

00:12:44.897 --> 00:12:45.591
And might die if we don't do anything.
What?

00:12:45.798 --> 00:12:48.392
Can't you do anything with magic?

00:12:48.601 --> 00:12:51.832
We don't have the oil of a tan ya fairy
needed for a healing spell.

00:12:51.937 --> 00:12:53.371
This can't be...

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:55.498
I know!

00:12:56.776 --> 00:12:59.438
Instead of using the
oil of the tan ya fairies...

00:12:59.545 --> 00:13:03.072
...we can cook discavas
in a large pot as a drink.

00:13:03.482 --> 00:13:07.112
| don't know what that means,
but I'm counting on you!

00:13:07.386 --> 00:13:08.410
Hey.

00:13:09.789 --> 00:13:11.086
Where's Eva?

00:13:12.591 --> 00:13:13.649
What's wrong?

00:13:13.759 --> 00:13:14.569
She ran away.

00:13:14.593 --> 00:13:16.357
She ran away.
Ran away? Why?

00:13:16.629 --> 00:13:18.461
She wasn't pleased.

00:13:18.664 --> 00:13:19.654
About what?

00:13:19.799 --> 00:13:21.494
About me sending you back...

00:13:21.600 --> 00:13:24.695
...and trying to send her off
to the Human Realm as well.

00:13:24.804 --> 00:13:25.965
I told her.

00:13:26.705 --> 00:13:29.800
About the destruction of this realm.
I told her everything.

00:13:29.975 --> 00:13:32.342
So you knew about it all along.

00:13:33.813 --> 00:13:36.111
| heard about it from the pirate.

00:13:36.282 --> 00:13:38.910
