00:13:39.785 --> 00:13:41.412
Ah, great.

00:13:41.554 --> 00:13:44.649
I'll go find Eva.
Take care of the pirate for me.

00:13:44.757 --> 00:13:45.553
Okay.

00:13:46.091 --> 00:13:46.785
Oh.

00:13:47.493 --> 00:13:48.460
Thanks.

00:13:48.561 --> 00:13:49.357
What?

00:13:49.562 --> 00:13:51.553
| know I disappointed you...

00:13:51.697 --> 00:13:55.065
...but you tried to help me
get back to the Human Realm.

00:13:55.167 --> 00:13:57.465
| was really happy about that.

00:13:59.004 --> 00:14:00.267
Unbelievable.

00:14:03.142 --> 00:14:04.871
Sheila is great.

00:14:05.277 --> 00:14:07.541
She sent Arusu back...

00:14:07.646 --> 00:14:11.549
...and she even had plans to send me
to the Human Realm as well.

00:14:12.284 --> 00:14:15.652
But compared to her,
| can't do anything.

00:14:16.021 --> 00:14:18.888
| can't even do anything for Sheila.

00:14:20.092 --> 00:14:21.719
What should I do?

00:14:21.861 --> 00:14:24.421
This realm is going to disappear.

00:14:24.530 --> 00:14:27.898
What can I do? I can't do anything!

00:14:29.235 --> 00:14:32.261
Giving up on yourself.

00:14:32.638 --> 00:14:36.302
That's where it all begins...

00:14:44.083 --> 00:14:45.573
Grandpa?

00:14:46.919 --> 00:14:48.853
Or maybe my grandma?

00:14:53.225 --> 00:14:54.715
Where am I?

00:14:54.994 --> 00:15:01.832
Little girl. You're inside a
very deep hole called despair.

00:15:03.168 --> 00:15:05.136
Hole of despair?

00:15:05.337 --> 00:15:08.500
No! Let me out! Let me out!

00:15:08.607 --> 00:15:10.132
Let me out!

00:15:10.276 --> 00:15:11.437
Look up.

00:15:11.944 --> 00:15:12.706
What?

00:15:13.112 --> 00:15:15.604
You can see a small light, can't you?

00:15:15.915 --> 00:15:18.441
That's the light of hope.

00:15:19.251 --> 00:15:23.745
Real hope can only be seen
when you look up...

00:15:23.856 --> 00:15:27.724
...from the very bottom of despair.

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:30.454
Real hope?

00:15:30.696 --> 00:15:31.595
Listen.

00:15:32.264 --> 00:15:35.723
Don't ever lose that light of hope.

00:15:36.435 --> 00:15:41.965
As long as you have that light of hope,
you can do anything, little girl.

00:15:42.508 --> 00:15:44.704
You can do anything.

00:15:45.744 --> 00:15:47.940
You can do anything...

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:49.775
| can do anything?

00:15:52.651 --> 00:15:54.449
Was that a dream?

00:15:58.190 --> 00:15:59.919
What? No way!

00:16:00.092 --> 00:16:02.823
| can't believe the warlocks are here!

00:16:05.297 --> 00:16:07.288
You must be an apprentice witch.

00:16:07.399 --> 00:16:09.629
Hand over the fairy!

00:16:10.102 --> 00:16:11.467
R-Right.

00:16:12.504 --> 00:16:17.203
If I do this, then both Sheila and
Arusu are going to laugh at me.

00:16:17.343 --> 00:16:20.643
Don't ever lose that light of hope.

00:16:20.946 --> 00:16:26.214
As long as you have that light of hope,
you can do anything, little girl.

00:16:26.318 --> 00:16:28.514
You can do anything.

00:16:30.322 --> 00:16:31.448
I'm

00:16:32.057 --> 00:16:33.286
I'm

00:16:33.659 --> 00:16:37.357
I'm a member of the
Magical Girl Squad too!

00:16:46.438 --> 00:16:47.337
It's no good.

00:16:47.773 --> 00:16:50.140
The discavas won't mix well.

00:16:51.410 --> 00:16:53.174
I did it, Sheila!

00:16:54.079 --> 00:16:56.013
| protected a fairy!

00:16:56.115 --> 00:16:58.584
| protected a fairy from the warlocks!

00:16:58.817 --> 00:17:01.218
That's a tan ya fairy!

00:17:02.287 --> 00:17:03.665
I'm sorry, Sheila.

00:17:03.689 --> 00:17:04.281
I'm sorry, Sheila.
What?

00:17:04.490 --> 00:17:06.959
| appreciate what you're trying to do...

00:17:07.059 --> 00:17:10.427
...but I can't just flee to
the Human Realm by myself.

00:17:10.629 --> 00:17:13.894
But even if you stay here,
there's nothing you can do.

00:17:13.999 --> 00:17:15.899
That's not true.

00:17:16.568 --> 00:17:17.967
| have hope.

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:20.630
Magic is supposed to create miracles.

00:17:20.739 --> 00:17:22.503
I'm going to do my best!

00:17:23.075 --> 00:17:23.871
Eva.

00:17:26.912 --> 00:17:28.346
Well said!

00:17:28.881 --> 00:17:29.871
Arusu!

00:17:30.149 --> 00:17:31.480
She came back.

00:17:31.583 --> 00:17:32.379
Really?

00:17:33.252 --> 00:17:34.811
