00:17:36.655 --> 00:17:41.115
Why? You need all three members
for the Magical Girl Squad!

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:43.121
That's why.

00:17:43.629 --> 00:17:45.028
Arusu!

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:45.995
Hey...

00:17:46.198 --> 00:17:49.168
Sheila. How's the pirate?

00:17:49.268 --> 00:17:51.999
That's right! Eva, we need
the oil of the tan ya fairy.

00:17:52.071 --> 00:17:52.629
What?

00:17:54.940 --> 00:17:57.307
Hang in there. I'll make
you feel better in no time.

00:17:57.409 --> 00:18:00.140
Wait a minute, Sheila. Let me do it.

00:18:00.512 --> 00:18:01.138
Okay.

00:18:05.884 --> 00:18:07.716
Light of hope.

00:18:15.627 --> 00:18:16.538
You're okay now.

00:18:16.562 --> 00:18:18.724
You're okay now.
You're amazing, Eva!

00:18:19.631 --> 00:18:23.465
