despite the pirate thing and all.

00:18:40.219 --> 00:18:41.778
A real lifesaver.

00:18:42.321 --> 00:18:43.755
I'm okay with it.

00:18:43.856 --> 00:18:45.300
| don't mind either.

00:18:45.324 --> 00:18:46.155
| don't mind either.
Really?

00:18:46.258 --> 00:18:49.626
Thank you! Isn't that great?

00:18:50.696 --> 00:18:52.130
