00:18:59.138 --> 00:19:02.199
Well, then let's just say we were lucky.

00:19:05.477 --> 00:19:07.104
We were saved...

00:19:07.913 --> 00:19:09.347
...because of this.

00:19:10.015 --> 00:19:11.210
That's the...

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:13.512
Why do you have this book?

00:19:13.952 --> 00:19:16.614
Talk to me in a softer tone.

00:19:17.823 --> 00:19:21.088
That book was given to me by my dad.

00:19:21.193 --> 00:19:24.094
I'm asking why you have it
in your possession!

00:19:24.396 --> 00:19:27.832
I told you this before.
I'm your mirror.

00:19:28.800 --> 00:19:30.859
You're also my mirror.

00:19:31.036 --> 00:19:34.028
So you brought me to
this Magical Realm, right?

00:19:34.106 --> 00:19:34.782
Is that true?

00:19:34.806 --> 00:19:35.898
Is that true?
Brought you here?

00:19:36.008 --> 00:19:39.444
That's what I was told,
but I'm really confused.

00:19:39.845 --> 00:19:41.939
You'll find out soon.

00:19:42.848 --> 00:19:45.010
Don't tell me you're the one...

00:19:45.384 --> 00:19:46.476
I mean...

00:19:47.186 --> 00:19:50.417
Apprentice witch.
Which district are you from?

00:19:50.756 --> 00:19:51.917
Answer me.

00:19:52.224 --> 00:19:56.092
Actually, I think it's more important
why the pirate had the book.

00:19:56.228 --> 00:19:56.990
Arusu.

00:19:57.162 --> 00:19:58.789
Just answer me!

00:20:02.134 --> 00:20:04.296
This realm was in an uproar.

00:20:04.536 --> 00:20:08.439
Only the True Book of Spells
knew our future.

00:20:17.082 --> 00:20:25.046
Come on, let's go!
Without closing our eyes...

00:20:25.224 --> 00:20:33.224
Our singing and laughter
fill the vast sky.

00:20:34.466 --> 00:20:42.466
We're headed for
our greatest longings.

00:20:43.675 --> 00:20:49.239
There's no wish
that can't come true.

00:20:49.348 --> 00:20:53.615
Let's just believe and fly away!

00:20:54.353 --> 00:20:58.586
No matter how hopeless it seems...
If we wish hard enough...

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:03.287
See, it'll turn info magic.

00:21:03.495 --> 00:21:08.661
Even the tiniest dream...
If it can bring somebody joy...

00:21:08.767 --> 00:21:11.828
Let's hope it does.

00:21:13.405 --> 00:21:17.899
Hey! DuDiDuWa...
We're laughing always, lalala...

00:21:18.010 --> 00:21:20.502
Let's sing your song and
smile and laugh with me.

00:21:20.612 --> 00:21:28.612
The truth is we're all waiting...

00:21:29.821 --> 00:21:35.521
...for the world of our dreams.

00:21:35.627 --> 00:21:39.825
So we might as well
Just make one of our own!
